{"task_id": "62b87af19a0c4fa8b80b34f7", "_id": "62b87af19a0c4fa8b80b34f7", "completion": "def difference(d1, d2, level=-1):\nif level == 0:\n\t\treturn d1\n\tif level == -1:\n\t\tlevel = len(d1)\n\tresult = {}\n\tfor k, v in d1.items():\n\t\tif k not in d2:\n\t\t\tresult[k] = v\n\t\telif isinstance(v, dict):\n\t\t\tresult[k] = difference(v, d2[k], level - 1)\n\t\telif v != d2[k]:\n\t\t\tresult[k] = v\n\treturn result", "generate_results": ["def difference(d1, d2, level=-1):\nif level == 0:\n\t\treturn d1\n\tif level == -1:\n\t\tlevel = len(d1)\n\tresult = {}\n\tfor k, v in d1.items():\n\t\tif k not in d2:\n\t\t\tresult[k] = v\n\t\telif isinstance(v, dict):\n\t\t\tresult[k] = difference(v, d2[k], level - 1)\n\t\telif v != d2[k]:\n\t\t\tresult[k] = v\n\treturn result"]}
