{"task_id": "62b869ebb4d922cb0e688cc6", "_id": "62b869ebb4d922cb0e688cc6", "completion": "def update_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor i, field in enumerate(observer_schema):\n\t\tif field[\"type\"] == \"object\":\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = {}\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]],\n\t\t\t\tfield[\"fields\"],\n\t\t\t\tresponse[i],\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telif field[\"type\"] == \"list\":\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = []\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]],\n\t\t\t\tfield[\"fields\"],\n\t\t\t\tresponse[i],\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = response[i]", "generate_results": ["def update_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor i, field in enumerate(observer_schema):\n\t\tif field[\"type\"] == \"object\":\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = {}\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]],\n\t\t\t\tfield[\"fields\"],\n\t\t\t\tresponse[i],\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telif field[\"type\"] == \"list\":\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = []\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]],\n\t\t\t\tfield[\"fields\"],\n\t\t\t\tresponse[i],\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tif field[\"name\"] not in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field[\"name\"]] = response[i]"]}
{"task_id": "62b869eab4d922cb0e688cc5", "_id": "62b869eab4d922cb0e688cc5", "completion": "def update_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor field in observer_schema[\"observed\"]:\n\t\tif field not in response:\n\t\t\traise KeyError(\n\t\t\t\tf\"{field} is not present in the Kubernetes response\"\n\t\t\t)\n\t\tif field in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\tif isinstance(last_applied_manifest[field], dict):\n\t\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field],\n\t\t\t\t\tobserver_schema[\"observed\"][field],\n\t\t\t\t\tresponse[field],\n\t\t\t\t)\n\t\t\telif isinstance(last_applied_manifest[field], list):\n\t\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field],\n\t\t\t\t\tobserver_schema[\"observed\"][field],\n\t\t\t\t\tresponse[field],\n\t\t\t\t)\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field] = response[field]\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field] = response[field]", "generate_results": ["def update_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor field in observer_schema[\"observed\"]:\n\t\tif field not in response:\n\t\t\traise KeyError(\n\t\t\t\tf\"{field} is not present in the Kubernetes response\"\n\t\t\t)\n\t\tif field in last_applied_manifest:\n\t\t\tif isinstance(last_applied_manifest[field], dict):\n\t\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_dict_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field],\n\t\t\t\t\tobserver_schema[\"observed\"][field],\n\t\t\t\t\tresponse[field],\n\t\t\t\t)\n\t\t\telif isinstance(last_applied_manifest[field], list):\n\t\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field],\n\t\t\t\t\tobserver_schema[\"observed\"][field],\n\t\t\t\t\tresponse[field],\n\t\t\t\t)\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field] = response[field]\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[field] = response[field]"]}
